      "writtenOn": "2023-03-13T21:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you can remove the whole print_panic_task_stack() for !CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SYSTEM_SAFE_MODE_PRINT_STACK. We\u0027ll catch an error at compilation time if somebody tries to call print_panic_task_stack without defining CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SYSTEM_SAFE_MODE_PRINT_STACK.",
