      "writtenOn": "2023-03-14T17:29:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That approach will fail to compile with:\n```\n/mnt/host/source/src/platform/ec/build/zephyr/skyrim/modules/ec/common/system_safe_mode.c:199:17: error: implicit declaration of function \u0027print_panic_task_stack\u0027 [-Werror\u003dimplicit-function-declaration]\n  199 |                 print_panic_task_stack();\n      |                 ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n```\nI could remove the static declaration on print_panic_task_stack and forward declare the prototype to work around this, but I\u0027m not sure if that\u0027s better.",
      "parentUuid": "c08b0348_d8ae1f98",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 206,
        "startChar": 1,
